1          /*===============================================================================
2           * sdtm_fulldomain_bug_chidvar.sas - Bug regression: character IDVAR fails
3           *===============================================================================
4           * Macro under test : %sdtm_fulldomain
5           * Expected         : a SUPP qualifier whose IDVAR points at a CHARACTER parent
6           *                    variable (e.g. AESPID) is merged onto the parent record
7           * Status           : FIXED 2026-10-29 - the key is converted only when the
8           *                    parent variable type is N (%var_attr); character keys are
9           *                    taken from IDVARVAL.  Kept as a regression test.
10          * Original defect  : "2. Core processing" always executed
11          *                      &idvar.=input(idvarval,best.);
12          *                    which re-created the parent key as NUMERIC.  For a
13          *                    character IDVAR the MERGE then failed:
14          *                      ERROR: Variable aespid has been defined as both
15          *                             character and numeric
16          *                    OUT was created with 0 observations and no values.
17          * Fix              : look up the type of &idvar. in PARENT (%var_attr) and only
18          *                    convert IDVARVAL when the parent variable is numeric;
19          *                    otherwise keep IDVARVAL as the character merge key.
20          * Test passes when  the defect is fixed (run_all then reports FIXED).
21          *============================================================================*/
